# UNDERDELVE: the opening, by buttons alone. The cartridge boots straight
# into Mo's camp. Walk east (the loose rock over the camp floor comes down
# behind him) into the gem grotto, hop up two planks for its gem, walk back
# into the camp, climb down the ladder in the camp floor to the owl's
# exchange, strike the chest there open and spend the ore on the copper pot
# and the climbing gloves. Not a lantern lost.
game underdelve
wait 15
expect state == 1
expect room_x == 6
expect room_y == 3
hold RIGHT 300
expect room_x == 7
expect room_y == 3
expect deaths == 0
hold RIGHT 75
hold A 3
wait 40
expect py == 98
hold RIGHT 15
hold A 3
wait 40
expect py == 66
hold RIGHT 55
expect money == 100
hold LEFT 250
expect room_x == 6
expect px == 230
expect py == 130
expect tile_3_8 == 97
expect deaths == 0
hold DOWN 240
expect room_x == 6
expect room_y == 4
hold RIGHT 30
press B
wait 20
expect money == 150
hold LEFT 125
press UP
wait 5
expect items & 1
expect money == 100
hold LEFT 32
press UP
wait 5
expect items & 8
expect money == 0
expect deaths == 0
expect lanterns == 6
